  "description_short": "Relaxed country restaurant on the old George road serving hearty home-style cooking in a rustic farm setting.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on the old George road near Groot Brakrivier, The Pot Restaurant offers a welcome escape from the highway hustle. The rustic farm setting and relaxed country atmosphere make it a favourite stop for travellers and locals alike seeking honest, home-style cooking.\n\nThe menu focuses on generous portions of comfort food done well—think traditional pot roasts, hearty stews, and classic South African fare that doesn't try to be fancy. It's the kind of place where you settle in for a proper meal, whether you're breaking up a Garden Route road trip or meeting friends for a leisurely Sunday lunch.\n\nWith its laid-back vibe and genuine country hospitality, The Pot delivers exactly what it promises: good food, generous servings, and a proper break from the road. The location on the R102 makes it easy to find, and the farm surroundings add to the appeal of a meal that feels worlds away from the highway.",
